      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.001.jpeg",
      "id" : "78C51DEF-E3C3-4BD9-8874-1DB57A943434",
      "title" : "シーン 1: 東方Project二次創作 powerd by zuyasi"
    },
    {
      "id" : "D6650A68-4156-41D5-879C-B489061FE54C",
      "telop" : "僕は、それから、自室に戻ってくると、感慨の気持ちに触れる。\n「短期間だったけど、色々とあったな…」っと。",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "backgroundName" : "一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg",
      "voiceDuration" : 7.974557823129252,
      "duration" : 8.574557823129252,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.002.jpeg",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_002_操夢.wav",
      "title" : "シーン 2",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #2",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "408E19E0-2F0F-4829-89BE-015E71E357AB",
      "telop" : "そして、そんな回想を終わらせると、荷物整理を始める。といっても、事前に大きなものは配送済みなので、ポケベルだけ持つ。",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "backgroundName" : "一人部屋３（夕方）.jpg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.706077097505668,
      "duration" : 9.306077097505668,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.003.jpeg",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_003_操夢.wav",
      "title" : "シーン 3",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #3",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "E9C31B5A-C93B-4E46-A30F-BA22B1269B67",
      "telop" : "そして、共同スペースに降りてくると、それぞれが準備を済ませたようだった。そして、早く帰宅した霊夢が話し始める。",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.10063492063492,
      "duration" : 8.70063492063492,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.004.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 4",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #4",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_004_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "6C346A9A-40D5-4AFC-B1DB-94D463A5ED08",
      "telop" : "「あんたたち、そろそろ、家を出るんでしょ。」",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 3.2194784580498865,
      "duration" : 3.8194784580498866,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.005.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 5",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #5",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_005_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "680B95FC-9541-4F5F-8F89-213D17416B24",
      "telop" : "「ええ、そうですよ。けど、魔理沙さんは、電話で聞けば、家に残るといって、さとりとこいしさんも残るみたいですよ。」",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.048458049886621,
      "duration" : 8.64845804988662,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.006.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 6",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #6",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_006_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "4ACC59AA-9490-44AF-8E9A-AEA06EA4E168",
      "telop" : "「でも…」",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 1.5,
      "duration" : 2.5,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.007.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 7",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #7",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_007_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "1805C97F-DBDA-4639-BD84-D69136FA28E6",
      "telop" : "「僕が時折こっちに来ますから、寂しい思いはさせませんよ。」",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 4.025646258503401,
      "duration" : 4.625646258503401,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.008.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 8",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #8",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_008_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "6F448C23-A69C-475F-B6EC-395337D65107",
      "telop" : "「そう…」",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 1.5,
      "duration" : 2.5,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.009.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 9",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #9",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_009_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "80370231-B789-4607-8847-3A3F4B55D4CA",
      "telop" : "僕は、それでも不安そうな彼女の背中に回り、そっと頭を撫でる。「これで、安心できますか？」",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 6.727823129251701,
      "duration" : 7.3278231292517,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.010.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 10",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #10",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_010_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "BA72BB75-BCD0-4693-8CF3-FDBFF5A58D0F",
      "telop" : "「ええ、ありがとう、操夢。」",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png",
      "voiceDuration" : 2.2419954648526077,
      "duration" : 2.841995464852608,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.011.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 11",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #11",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_011_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "5014F492-0A05-4AD4-A3D1-6579D2C26FE9",
      "telop" : "「操夢、車が来たみたいだよ。」",
      "characterName" : "フランドール・スカーレット",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png",
      "voiceDuration" : 2.5894784580498866,
      "duration" : 3.1894784580498867,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.012.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 12",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #12",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_012_フランドール・スカーレット.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "フランドール・スカーレット",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "60D0F212-1F06-4237-97CE-93350D955758",
      "telop" : "「それじゃあ、行ってきますね。あと、魔理沙さんに、こないだの件、頼んでありますから、耳立てて聞いてください。」",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "characterImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/霊夢（笑い）.png",
      "voiceDuration" : 7.775646258503401,
      "duration" : 8.375646258503401,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.013.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 13",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #13",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/Application\/Resource\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_013_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "E1BF1636-C598-42DF-B9C0-6E7A397B3E91",
      "telop" : "「えっ…」私は彼の一言に、そう呟いているうちに、彼は、そのまま、フランたちの元に向かって言った。",
      "characterName" : "博麗霊夢",
      "backgroundName" : "リビング（夕方）.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 8.593242630385488,
      "duration" : 9.193242630385488,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.014.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/リビング（夕方）.jpg",
      "title" : "シーン 14",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #14",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_reimu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_014_博麗霊夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "博麗霊夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "telop" : "彼がフランたちの実家に着くと…",
      "backgroundName" : "単色背景",
      "animationName" : "なし",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #15",
      "duration" : 3,
      "characterName" : "フランドール・スカーレット",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.015.jpeg",
      "id" : "1539ED2A-B85E-4EF0-8FF6-E1373E077281",
      "title" : "シーン 15: 彼がフランたちの実家に着くと…"
    },
    {
      "id" : "38F5C753-A7B5-485A-9F20-2FE3590758EC",
      "telop" : "「想定よりも、大きいですね…、この屋敷…」\n僕は、フランたちと共にこの屋敷に入って最初の一言を言う。",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "backgroundName" : "nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 7.566507936507937,
      "duration" : 8.166507936507937,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.016.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd",
      "title" : "シーン 16",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #16",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_016_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "8CD4BF8E-AEDC-4139-BDAC-61EBAA1ED88E",
      "telop" : "「でも、慣れて仕舞えば、こんなもんですよ。」\n私は、彼の一言にそう返す。",
      "characterName" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "backgroundName" : "nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 4.885283446712018,
      "duration" : 5.4852834467120175,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.017.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd",
      "title" : "シーン 17",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #17",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_017_十六夜咲夜.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "A044CE90-6FFF-4525-83E7-E40452933F7D",
      "telop" : "「そうですか…、それで、僕の部屋は？」",
      "characterName" : "操夢",
      "backgroundName" : "nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 2.584331065759637,
      "duration" : 3.184331065759637,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.018.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd",
      "title" : "シーン 18",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #18",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_soumu",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_018_操夢.wav",
      "voiceCharacter" : "操夢",
      "animationName" : "なし"
    },
    {
      "id" : "08A068A9-ABE8-4651-9D10-A6ACAE0EC4E8",
      "telop" : "「今から、案内しますね。」\n私はそう言うと、彼に割り当てた部屋の場所に彼を案内する。",
      "characterName" : "十六夜咲夜",
      "backgroundName" : "nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.jpeg",
      "voiceDuration" : 5.3965986394557826,
      "duration" : 5.996598639455782,
      "transitionName" : "なし",
      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474\/交換夫婦（30話目）_9043eff474.019.jpeg",
      "backgroundImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc213186_紅魔館ロビー.pxd",
      "title" : "シーン 19",
      "slideTitle" : "スライド #19",
      "audioTrack" : "track_voice_%E5%8D%81%E5%85%AD%E5%A4%9C%E5%92%B2%E5%A4%9C",
      "voiceAudioPath" : "\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_019_十六夜咲夜.wav",
